window.products.push({"id":964008,"name":"Wynd Plus Smart Personal Air Purifier with Air Quality Sensor - App Integrated, Night Mode Air Cleaner - Monitors Air Quality – Ideal for Home, Desk, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713amfVIeSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WYND PLUS AIR PURIFIER - Engineered to generate a positive pressure bubble to keep bad air out. Wynd’s personal purifier traps particles such as pollen, pet dander, dust, and pollution in a medical-grade filter. This system automatically adjusts itself to clean air fast or slow based on your local air quality stations. PERSONAL AIR QUALITY SENSOR - The Plus comes with a built-in, detachable air quality sensor that continuously monitors the air around you and alerts you when the air becomes unhealthy. Pair your Plus with the Wynd app to remotely monitor your air quality, control your Wynd devices, and observe air quality trends for optimal health and comfort. POWERFUL DESIGN - Speed and power in the palm of your hand. Designed by engineers from NASA and MIT, Wynd portable air purifiers are powerful enough to remove 99.99% of pollutants in a car cabin in under 15 minutes by purifying up to 8 liters of air per second. LIGHTWEIGHT & PORTABLE - Breathe clean air no matter where life takes you. Wynd Plus is as small as a water bottle and can fit in a cup-holder, so you can use it anywhere: airplane, car, office, small rooms, inside baby strollers, and more. When it's not plugged in, Wynd Plus lasts for about 8 hours on normal use. FILTRATION TECHNOLOGY - With a high purification rate to size ratio and a filter that lasts from 3 to 4 months, Wynd is ready to clean your air literally anywhere. Through the app, we can track usage to tell you how used up the filter is and alert you when it’s time to order a replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713amfVIeSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wynd","source_asin":"B071DXQ1RV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071DXQ1RV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071DXQ1RV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
