window.products.push({"id":964126,"name":"Vtopmart Spice Drawer Organizer, 2 Pack Plastic Spice Rack Organizer Expandable From 13\" to 26\" for Drawer Cabinet, Expandable 3 Tier Seasoning Organi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vZ7M+LmkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Expandable Drawer Spice Organizer：This spice organizer can be expandable to any width to fit your drawers perfectly. Totally 2 pack, each can be expanded from 7\" to 13\", two of them can be expanded from 13\" to 26\", which can organize about 48 standard size spice jars. The height of he spice drawer should be at least 3 inch. Please measure the length and depth of your drawer before you place order. Easy to See & Perfect Storage：3 Tier spice drawer organizer save you plenty of storage space and keeps the spice drawer organized. No need to install and easy to used. Just put it in the drawer, the slanted levels allow you to quickly read the labels on the bottles,so easy to take spices out and put them back,not have to search around. So they never take over kitchen countertops, cabinet drawers and create a mess. Multifunctional Use: Not just limited to spice storage, It's great tool to organize any easoning, curry, salt baking supplies. Use this for organize foundation, nail polish, perfume, lipstick, and other cosmetics in makeup drawer. Perfect to organize medications and toiletries. Make your drawers look organized, clean and tidy. Unique Design：The slim shape fits most drawers, The side baffles of the container are wide enough to hold majority sizes and shapes of spice bottles. This definitely serves the purpose for those everyday use spices. It can effectively hold the spice jar, prevent it from sliding around in the drawer. Now all you have to do is slide a drawer open, and you can see all of the spices lined up. There is no better way to organize spices than this. Easy to clean & Sturdy: Made of sturdy and durable polyethylene material, not a flimsy piece of plastic. Not wrap, yellowing, No rust. A Total of 2 sets of spice drawer organizer, each set contains 2 pieces of drawer cabinet spice racks. One piece measures is 16.5”L x 7.5”W x 1.5” H. DO NOT place in dishwasher!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vZ7M+LmkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vtopmart","source_asin":"B09834NL9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09834NL9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09834NL9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
