window.products.push({"id":964191,"name":"L-Bulice Electric Can Opener, Restaurant Can Opener, Multifunctional Can Opener, Full – Automatic Hands Free Can Opener for Chef's, Individuals, Arthr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gvmoGXqVL._AC_SL1138_.jpg","description":"Description This can opener designed to solve your troubles, it is the best choice for Chef's, individuals, arthritis and housewife ◂Ergonomic Design：Our can opener is ergonomically designed with high quality ABS material and stainless steel cutting knives. It is high in hardness, corrosion resistant, easy to clean, and can be in contact with food, non-toxic and safe, safe and healthy. ◂Embedded blade：The can opener has a sharp blade and is securely embedded in the device to prevent accidental cuts of fingers when searching for tools in the kitchen drawer. ◂Metal gear：To open the can, position the edge of the can between the blade and the metal gear. The metal gear guides the edge of the can through the can opener, moving itself to a full 360° circle. ◂Stand alone button：The can opener has only one button, press it, can opener will open the can automatically ◂Magnet：When you remove the can opener from the can, the magnet on the can opener will help you pick up the lid, no need to fish the can with your fingers! ◂Strong Motor：Powered by 2 AA batteries(Not Included). After putting in 2 batteries, the can opener begin to walk around the can edge automatically. ►Note 1. Please read all instructions carefully before using the can opener. 2. This can opener is not suitable for children, please keep out of reach of children. 3. Make sure the motor is completely stopped before removing the bottom cover. 4. This Can Opener will not open rimless cans or cans with odd corners.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gvmoGXqVL._AC_SL1138_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L-Bulice","source_asin":"B09LQF5ZZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LQF5ZZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LQF5ZZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
