window.products.push({"id":964214,"name":"Soccer Gifts for Kids Night Light, Linakx Dimmable LED NightLight, 3D Optical Illusion Lamp with Remote Control 16 Colors Changing, Room Decor Birthda","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uhp4FMwmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Soccer Gift Ideas: If your child likes soccer or is a sports fan, then this soccer light must be the best gift idea. This soccer 3D night light will bring a good night and sleep atmosphere to the bedroom, with color change and 3D visual appearance, which creating the most special bedroom decoration. This is a speical birthday gift, Christmas gift, soccer gifts, holiday gift idea for your children, friends and parents, as well as a unique bedroom decoration idea. 3D Visual Effects: The soccer night light laser engraved optical acrylic silicone plate, the illusion effect makes the room unique and warm when lit. The soccer light is the perfect companion for sleep. In the dark night, as long as there is a moderate amount of light, your child will feel very comfortable , Provide a good night and sleep for your child. (Note: 3D is only visual, the light itself is flat) Adjustable Muti-Color Night Light: The 3D lamp emits soft light that does not flicker and does not dazzle the eyes. The dimmable function also protects your child's eyes from any damage. This soccer gift has 7 color changing by touch control and 16 colors changing by remote control, you can keep one color or rotate all colors which allows you to turn your room into something different and interesting every night with the color of your choice. Touch&Remote Control: Soccer night light comes with remote control and touch control. It is easy for children to operate and control the night light. Touch the power button on the base to change the color or turn on/off the light. You can also use the remote control to aim the light base to adjust the brightness or change Color and 4 flashing modes to control the night light. It's very suitable for your bedside decorative lamp and bedside table lamp. Dual Power Choice: Soccer gifts for kids has two power supply methods. You can use this soccer night light through a USB cable powered supply. If you don't have any power supply nearby, you can use battery (not included) to light up the light. Everyone will love this lamp, it is suitable for children, teenagers, men, women. The light is easy to carry and can be easily moved to any place you want which can be taken to overnight, birthday party, or even grandparents' house.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uhp4FMwmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linkax","source_asin":"B09FFD8VKX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FFD8VKX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FFD8VKX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
