window.products.push({"id":964337,"name":"West Bend 84754 4-Quart Slow Cooker (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XB07Q9Q0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description 4-Qt Slow Cooker with Insulated Tote Amazon.com The 4-quart West Bend slow cooker takes the hassle out of home-cooking, by preparing your meals while you're at work or play. With five settings to choose from, the 300-watt unit takes 2-10 hours and handles everything from vegetable sides to chicken. You can also add delicate ingredients at the last minute or use it to keep foods warm. The technique of the slow cooker also works well on less expensive cuts of meat, so you save money without sacrificing tenderness. Outfitted for versatile use, the appliance's parts can be used on their own as well as in combination. The nonstick base doubles as a small griddle, the glass cover can be used in the microwave, and the nonstick metal pot can go on the stovetop or in the oven. West Bend includes several recipes to get you started and tips for adapting your favorite dishes to slow cooking. The unit measures 13-1/4 by 8-1/2 by 7-3/4 inches, and the pot and lid are dishwasher-safe. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XB07Q9Q0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West Bend","source_asin":"B000092WDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000092WDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000092WDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
