window.products.push({"id":964389,"name":"Dalstrong BBQ Pitmaster & Meat Knife - 9 inch - Shadow Black Series - Marauder Red Edition - Red Non-Stick Coating - High Carbon - 7CR17MOV-X Vacuum T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":97.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tP+qejPhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No culinary knife on the market can compete with the Marauder Edition 9\" Pitmaster knife when it comes to form and function. This knife is one of the most fierce looking creations Dalstrong has made, but it’s the functionality that will make you truly love it. The forked tip doesn’t just look aggressive, it can also grab, flip, and skewer meat from the board to the grill and from grill to plate. The built-in bottle opener helps quench your thirst and the razor-sharp blade slices up dinner in no time. The sharp, aerodynamic lines of the Shadow Black Series are inspired by the F-117 Nighthawk Stealth Fighter jet. The Marauder edition takes this bold series even further, forgoing the matte black color for a haunting, deep, blood red. This series features an exceptional grip, screamingly sharp cutting edge, and is engineered for optimal maneuverability. Striking from every angle, the unique handle geometry is optimized for grip and tucks snugly into the palm so you can maneuver it with the prowess of the elite fighter jet that inspired it. Ruthlessly sharp, the Shadow Black Series edge is painstakingly honed by expert craftsmen to 16-18°– ensuring clean, precise cuts and excellent edge-retention. An intense heat-treatment followed by a deep-freeze nitrogen cooling process enhances hardness and flexibility. Full-tang for maximum durability, the knife is further upgraded with a menacing blood red nonstick coating, improving robustness and corrosion resistance, and keeping your knife cleaner, longer. The handle's tapered bolster ensures a comfortable pinch grip, while the angular G10 resin material is near impervious to kitchen damage and affords lifelong durability. The unique design of the Shadow Black Series' handle affords a rock solid grip, allowing your hand and palm to wrap around effortlessly while your middle finger sits comfortably within a groove near the choil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tP+qejPhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalstrong","source_asin":"B0BCH9M2J5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCH9M2J5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCH9M2J5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
