window.products.push({"id":964439,"name":"Elama RETROBLOOM Retro Bloom 16 Piece Luxurious Stoneware Dinnerware with Complete Setting for 4, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DBHgRdqQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a beautiful accent to your dining table with the Elama Retro bloom 16 piece round stoneware dinnerware set in Green. Each dish is creatively crafted into unique and contemporary shapes and beautifully colored in elegant light Green with earthy olive accents. Stoneware construction is ideal for special occasion gatherings and every day use. Each plate is microwave safe for quick reheating and dishwasher safe for easy cleaning. set: 16 piece dinnerware material: stoneware color: green pattern: olive shape: round microwave safe dishwasher safe includes: four 8\" Dessert plates four 15oz. Bowls four 10oz. Mugs per item Measurements: dessert plate: 8\" Diameter, 0. 5\" Height, 0. 80lb. Weight bowl: 5. 5\" Diameter, 3\" Height, 12oz. Capacity, 0. 95lbs. Weight mug: 3. 5\" Diameter, 4\" Height, 3\" Handle, 10oz. Capacity, 0. 70lb. Weight","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DBHgRdqQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elama","source_asin":"B0815XTN9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0815XTN9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0815XTN9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
