window.products.push({"id":964441,"name":"Shower Rod Holders for Wall, Adhesive Shower Curtain Rod Holder No Drilling, 2 Pack Waterproof Shower Rod Mount Retainer for Wall (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GIu-YGOnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABS 【Secure and Convenient】Prevent shower curtain rods from falling off the walls and ensure safety while taking a bath with our shower curtain rod holders. Suitable for most shower curtain rods in the market, these holders can withstand up to 60-80 pounds with their 2.36 inch diameter sticker. 【Two Installation Methods】Our shower curtain rod holders are versatile and can be installed on all kinds of bathroom walls. For uneven or rough walls, screws can be used to install the mount without drilling or causing damage. For flat and smooth walls, the rod retainer can be easily installed by peeling and pasting without any tools or drilling. 【Protect Your Family and Tiles】The no-drill design of these holders ensures that the falling shower curtain rod will not hurt family members or damage the bathtub tiles, providing an extra layer of safety. 【Easy to Install】Installing these holders is a breeze - just make sure the wall is flat and clean, peel off the protective film of the double-sided adhesive tape, and stick it to your predetermined position. Press it for 30 seconds to ensure a strong and secure hold. 【Versatile Use】These holders are not just limited to bathroom curtains - they can also be used on wardrobe, cabinet, clothes hanger, closet, window curtains, pantry, or other interior decoration that needs to fix the rod. Our products are durable and will not be damaged during normal use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GIu-YGOnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riozoo","source_asin":"B0C23RKK21","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C23RKK21","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C23RKK21","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":964442,"name":"Jumbo Egg Cartons Holds 12 Eggs Printed Natural Pulp - 1 Dozen Large - Strong Sturdy Material Perfect For Storing Extra Eggs - by MT Products (15 Cart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ip5XyayuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Recycled Pulp Made in USA LARGE CARTONS: These rustic egg cartons are perfecting for storing and securing up to a dozen eggs. Have extra eggs and no place to put them? These cartons can snugly store up to twelve jumbo eggs! Stock up on chicken eggs or keep your duck eggs safe in this perfectly secure container. EXCELLENT MATERIAL: Made of high quality sustainable recycled pulp material and designed to absorb humidity so your eggs stay dry and fresh. The sturdiness and thickness ensures no breakage while transporting or lifting. These cartons are even more durable than the ones used in local stores! REUSABLE: Cartons are sturdy enough that they will hold up to their multiple uses. Firm fit and secure lid allows daily use of opening and closing while still keeping these cartons in perfect condition. You can use it over and over again and it will still be as good as new! MAKE IT PERSONAL: For your convenience, there is plenty of room to stamp your logo, write a brief message, or indicate what type of egg you are selling. Hand these out at the market with your farm's name for a truly personalized experience. MULTI USAGE: Great idea for Arts and Crafts classroom projects or seed trays. They also store homemade bath bombs perfectly. Hide twelve little surprises in them like prizes, candy, or stickers, tie with a bow, and you can have adorable homemade gift packages to give to a loved one!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Ip5XyayuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MT Products","source_asin":"B071GM1859","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071GM1859","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071GM1859","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":964443,"name":"Kitchen Faucet Sink Splash Guard Silicone Faucet Sink Water Catcher Mat Draining Pad Splash Countertop Rubber Drying Mat for Kitchen Bathroom Countert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iuVfqGj+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our kitchen sink mats fit perfectly on your countertop and upgrade your kitchen sink in the least effortless way! This means your countertops will stay dry forever, and you won't have to worry about splattering your countertops. This means no puddles to clean up & no water spots by the faucet. Silicone upgrade enhanced version faucet pads are newly designed for faucet splashes, no longer made of hard-to-clean fabrics that takes a lot of time to dry, so don't worry about the wet fabric mat, or wash the mat and dry it. Suitable for almost all types of sink faucets in kitchens, bathrooms, RVs, cafes, restaurants, etc., saving you from wiping down countertops every day. This dark gray luxurious color also elevates your home decor. The faucet splash pad is easy to install and fits snugly around faucet, securing the pad to the faucet base. This means never gets soggy, or any water spots by the faucet, you don't need to worry about the water staying on the mat or counter. Faucet mat have multiple diversion grooves, which can quickly guide the overflowing water through the diversion grooves to the water outlet, ensuring that your sink is always dry. Made from 100% silicone, soft and reliable, reusable and durable, totally safe to use. Silicone sink faucet mat drains water directly into your sink, no more tedious drying, and makes your kitchen sink a perfect upgrade!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iuVfqGj+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joyousness","source_asin":"B09Z21P19N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z21P19N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z21P19N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
