window.products.push({"id":964495,"name":"Bamboo Steamer Basket Kit, Dumpling Maker, Handmade Cookware for cooking,Two Tier,Healthy Food Steamer for Cooking Bao Bun, Dim Sum Unique Gifts for F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718l4AxOIVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FEATURES: ● Conveniently steam meat, veggies, dim sum, and dumplings to perfection ● Steam cooking provides a healthy, low-fat alternative to cooking in oils ● Helps retain vitamins, minerals, and color in your foods ● Easy to clean by hand, dry before storing ● Fits Most Kitchen Pots WHAT YOU GET: 1 x 8\" Bamboo Steamer Basket 2 x Bamboo Chopsticks 1 x Stylish Sauce Dish 3 x Dumpling Maker Mold 2 x Chopsticks Holder 1 x Speciality Dough Roller 1 x Stuffing Wooden Spatula 20 x Liner Papers HOW TO USE BAMBOO STEAMER: 1- Line the bottom of the basket with cabbage or lettuce leaves. 2- Find a pot that your steamer will fit in snugly like a wok and fill it with about 2\" of water. 3- Simmer the water without the steamer in it, do not boil. 4- Set the steamer in the pot with the lid on and your food inside. 5- Check frequently for doneness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718l4AxOIVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tisonaz","source_asin":"B09B38H32N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B38H32N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B38H32N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":964496,"name":"Le Creuset Enameled Cast-Iron 3-1/2-Quart Oval French Oven, Flame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Da9QvXWHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description With its elongated oval shape designed for longer cuts of meat, this 3-1/2-quart enameled cast-iron French oven works exceptionally well for preparing smaller game, fowl, and poultry like traditional pigeonneau, quail, cornish hen, and chicken. Measuring 9 by 12-8/9 by 5-4/5 inches, the unit not only easily accommodates larger ingredients, but its functional profile also maximizes convenient side-by-side space on the stovetop. Made of heavy-duty cast iron, the cookware's colorful, long-lasting exterior enamel resists chipping and cracking, while its durable, nonreactive sand-colored interior enamel offers a smooth surface for cooking and an optimal palette for food presentation. As cast iron is unexcelled for even heat distribution and superior heat retention, and enamel is impervious to acids and odors, the oven browns and cooks food uniformly and gently without hot spots and can be used for marinating, cooking on the stovetop, or finishing in the oven. Two loop cast-iron side handles help ensure a steady grip during transport--even when wearing bulky oven mitts, and the unit's secure-fitting lid locks in heat and moisture while cooking. The lid also comes fitted with a black phenolic knob that's oven-safe up to 350 degrees F. Beautiful enough for the table yet durable enough to outlive its lifetime limited warranty, the French oven can be safely used on any stovetop, including induction, and should be hand washed for best results. Amazon.com Beautiful enough for the table and durable enough to outlive its lifetime warranty against defects, this heavy pot is perfect for preparing and ceremoniously serving such dishes as choucroute garni and braised lamb shanks. The oval shape suits poultry and thick cuts of meat while providing room for vegetables. Since it's safe on any stovetop, including induction, as well as in the oven, the pot can also be used for soups and chili. Made of cast iron, with both the exterior and interior clad in two coats of Le Creuset's famous bright enamel, the pot holds 3-1/2 quarts, perfect for one- and two-person households. Cast iron is unexcelled at heat distribution and retention and enamel is impervious to acids and odors, so the pot cooks food evenly and gently without hot spots and can even be used for marinating and baking. It's also dishwasher-safe. The pot's heavy, tight-fitting lid has a synthetic knob that's ovenproof to 450 degrees F. Like all Le Creuset cast-iron cookware, the pot is hand cast in a one-of-a-kind sand mold and is hand finished at the Le Creuset factory in France. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Da9QvXWHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B00005QFQL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005QFQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005QFQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
