window.products.push({"id":964700,"name":"Closet Shelves Tower - Modular Closet System with Shoe Shelves (8) - Corner Closet System - Closet Organizers and Storage Shelves (White, 25.5 inches ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":504.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bW39VPB9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Modular Closet Shoe Rack section is an all-wood organizing closet kit that will completely transform your closet. The Shoe Rack comes with eight slanted shelves and is perfect for organizing shoes folded clothing, or handbags, and for displaying decorative closet accessories. This Closet organization system with shelves is great for closet systems for walk-in closets, closet systems for small closets, and any space you want to install a closet kit or shelving for the closet. Our closet organizers and storage system are made right here in New Jersey, using US-manufactured wood board. Our walk-in closet organizer systems, walk-in closet organizers, and storage shelves for closet & closet wall shelves are so easy to install and will last for years to come. Modular Closets are made up of different parts - called modules. Some modules have lots of hanging space, some have drawers, some have shelf space, and some have them all. By combining these modules in different ways your closet has infinite possibilities. (You can find our variety of modules on our Amazon storefront.) So, grab a tape measure, a notepad, and a pen. Draw a rough sketch of your closet layout so you can come back to it for reference. Measure each wall in three places: Bottom, middle and top. Write down your measurements and use the shortest one for your final sketch. Now, do the same for the other walls. You now have your closet dimensions. Use your imagination to envision what you want in your closet and fill your walls with closet modules.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bW39VPB9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MC Modular Closets","source_asin":"B08RB87FNB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RB87FNB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RB87FNB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
