window.products.push({"id":964721,"name":"AFMAT Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless, No Touch Hand Sanitizer Dispenser, 15.2 oz Countertop Hand Soap Dispenser w/Adjustable Volume, Black, 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ANrGRdVyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【TOUCH-FREE SOAP DISPENSER】At this special time, we need to wash hands more often. Our hand soap dispenser ensures no germs or smudges left behind. With a larger capacity of 15.2 oz(450ml), you don't need to replenish regularly. Perfect for kitchen and bathroom. 【FAST AND PRECISE DISPENSING】With built-in infrared motion and precise sensor detection technology, this automatic soap dispenser can detect your hand instantly and dispense soap in just 0.2 seconds. There are 4 levels of soap volume. Press on button to choose the amount of soap you and your family need and stop wasting soap. 【NO MESSY DRIPS & NO JAMS】High-efficient motor and gear pump structure makes this hand sanitizer dispenser last longer than other brand. Flexible silicone valve shuts quickly to avoid messy drips. This electric soap dispenser touchless can be refilled with any hand sanitizer, shampoo, dishwashing detergent, alcohol or other high density liquid soap. Note: When fill in liquid with high density, please try 2-3 times and it will begin dispensing. 【BATTERY OPERATED & IPX6 WATERPROOF】Powered by 4 AA batteries(not included), this liquid hand soap dispenser comes with a battery compartment lock design and IPX6 waterproof material, which prevents the battery compartment from corrosion when immersed in water. Note: Please close the battery cover thoroughly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ANrGRdVyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AFMAT","source_asin":"B08NDG8H3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NDG8H3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NDG8H3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
