window.products.push({"id":964729,"name":"JAGUAR Parking Only Sign - Miniature Fun Parking Signs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518bCeBxHzL._AC_.jpg","description":"At around 2/3rds the size of a regular street sign, Fun Parking Signs are an ideal size to use in and around the home, office, workshop or den. Even though they might be small, they could really be described as the \"Goldilocks\" size. Not too big, Not too small - Just Right! Yet, they are still big enough to get the message across to others, in a fun and yet inoffensive way as to whose parking spot this really is. Fun Parking Signs are manufactured using a highly resilient and waterproof sheet plastic called polypropylene and as they weigh only about 60 grams (2 ounces) and are ideal to use inside the house as they can be easily hung without damaging your walls because they can be attached to any surface by simply applying a small amount pliable adhesive tack to the back (not included). Alternatively, they could be fixed more securely using thumbtacks or double-sided tape. Fun Parking Signs can also be used outside because of their high UV rating and strong resistance to weathering. Meaning they will last out outside for years - even in the harshest conditions. Miniature Fun parking signs make a great gift for lots of different applications in and around the home or office and make a great inexpensive gift for the motoring enthusiast or for family and friends. Get one for yourself or someone you know.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518bCeBxHzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"funparkingsigns","source_asin":"B00JSRC9C8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JSRC9C8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JSRC9C8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
