window.products.push({"id":964780,"name":"Dash Sensations Sensory Kids Body Pillow – Ultra Soft Plush Removable Cover – Large 30” Roll Cushion with Tactile Mini Beads for Naps, Sleeping, Play ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bmmkXrw3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Dash Sensations we never take comfort for granted and we want to make sure your kids are cozy too and with our Kids Body Pillow your children can enjoy everyday leisure. High-quality materials and soothing sensory beads help promote comfort and sleep. A removable washable cover makes it easy to clean so you won’t have to worry about accidents or spills. Your child can rest, play and enjoy quality comfort at home. Its snuggly, its cuddly and it perfect for kids! BENEFITS & FEATURES: Removable Plush Zipper Cover Sensory Beads  Perfect for Bedtime or Naptime Decorative Pillow Outer Cover: 92% Polyester, 8% Spandex Inside Cover: 100% Polystyrene 30” Long and 6” Wide Available in Pale Pink and Light Blue SENSORY BEADS HELP KIDS SLEEP The soothing interior provides a soft and soothing feel that makes rest and relaxation feel like a dream. Boys and girls will relish in the happiness that this extra-large pillow provides. Whether your kid is in a deep slumber or enjoying some leisure after a long school day they’ll look forward to the comforting feel of this cushion. Your kids can enjoy comfort as they read books or watch TV. HEALTHY SLEEP Keep your kids from tossing and turning. It may also help to align your children’s hips, neck, shoulders and back while they lay. It’s big enough for them to hold onto and it provides support for their neck and head. It may also help improve posture. GREAT FOR TRAVEL Not only is this cozy cushion great at home it’s also great for travel. Pack it in the car for road trips so your kid can feel more comfortable and sleep during long travel periods. It may be hard for children to sleep in airplanes, trains or cars but with the help of this body pillow, your little ones can sleep just as well as they sleep at home. Don’t leave the cuddles at home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bmmkXrw3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dash Sensations","source_asin":"B07MP7NW25","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MP7NW25","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MP7NW25","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
