window.products.push({"id":964877,"name":"SimPure HP9 Air Purifier for Home Large Room & Bedroom & Office, Quiet True HEPA Filter Air Cleaner for Allergies, Pets, Smokers, Eliminates Allergens","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MGtIpXh4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"True H13 HEPA Filter, 100% Ozone Free - SimPure HP9 air cleaner captures and reduces up to 99.97% of contaminants as small as 0.3 microns in the air, including allergens, fine dust, pet dander, pet hair, pollen, mold spores, cigarette smoke, odors, VOC's and more. Ideal for smokers, allergies, and pet owners. High-Efficiency and Wide Coverage Filtration - With the CADR rating of 120 CFM (203 m³/h), HP9 covers a room size up to 225sq ft. in 15 minutes, 450sq ft. in 30 minutes, 900sq ft. in one hour. Perfect for small to large rooms covering living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, baby nurseries, basement, and offices. Tested and Trustworthy - HP9 is a CARB-certified air cleaner since it complies with California's strictest safety standards - the California Air Resource Board for indoor cleaning devices. And it is also CE certified and ELT listed. User-friendly Design - Three optional fan speeds (Low / Medium / High) meet various purification needs and sizes of the space. Noise levels as low as 25dB in sleep mode create an ultra-quiet restful environment for studying, working, or sleeping. Bonus features include a Timer for 1h/2h/4h auto-off, a Filter Replacement Indicator, and a Child Lock preventing misoperation. Warm Tips - As for HP9, please kindly note that it's time to replace genuine HP9 replacement filter (Search B08Y1KD5Y5) when the \"timer\" buttons are flashing or every 6 months. And please long press the \"speed\" button and \"timer\" button for 3~5s at the same time until the light is off to reset it after you replace the filter. Note: Remove the protective plastic from the filter pre-installed in the air purifier before running it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MGtIpXh4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SimPure","source_asin":"B08XMB7VBV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XMB7VBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XMB7VBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
