window.products.push({"id":964958,"name":"Howard Elliott Daniel Leaner Full Size Floor Mirror, Freestanding Deco Stone Metal Full Length Leaning Wall Mirror for Home Decoration for Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":600.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o-gWxEQQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Daniel Mirror is a simple rectangular frame. It is characterized by a variegated bar pattern around the frame. It is then finished in an antique mottled silver giving the piece a contemporary 3D stripe effect. The Daniel Mirror is a perfect accent piece for an entryway, bathroom, bedroom or any room in your home. D-rings are affixed to the back of the mirror so it is ready to hang right out of the box in either a horizontal or vertical orientation! The mirrored glass on this piece is beveled adding to its beauty and style. Its oversized frame is perfect for leaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o-gWxEQQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Elliott Collection","source_asin":"B004SKPX9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-964958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004SKPX9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004SKPX9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
